            "text": "I'm so sorry to hear that your desk lamp broke! I completely understand how frustrating that must be.\n\nUnfortunately, I'm not able to process a refund for order 1003. According to our refund policy, refunds must be requested within 30 days of purchase, and it's been 45 days since you purchased the desk lamp.\n\n**Our refund policy states:**\n- Orders are refundable within 30 days of purchase\n- Final-sale items are not refundable\n- The order must have been delivered\n\nI know this isn't the answer you were hoping for. However, I'd encourage you to reach out to our customer service team directly, as they may be able to offer other solutions or assistance, especially since the lamp is defective. They might have warranty options or other ways to help that fall outside of our standard refund policy.\n\nIs there anything else I can help you with today?",
